---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
	title="About" 
	description="Learn about Nomad Poker creator Randy Glover, the legendary game designer behind Jumpman, and the story behind this innovative card game."
>
	<Hero 
		title="About Nomad Poker"
		subtitle="From the Creator of Jumpman"
	/>
	
	<!-- Randy Glover Section -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-emerald-950">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<Card>
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-400 mb-6">Meet the Creator: Randy Glover</h2>
					<div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
						<p class="text-amber-50 text-lg mb-4">
							Nomad Poker is the brainchild of <strong class="text-yellow-400">Randy Glover</strong>, a legendary game designer 
							with a storied history in the gaming industry. Randy is best known as the creator of <strong class="text-yellow-400">Jumpman</strong>, 
							a classic platform game that captured the hearts of gamers in the early days of personal computing.
						</p>
						<p class="text-amber-50 text-lg mb-4">
							With decades of experience in game design and a passion for creating engaging, innovative experiences, 
							Randy has brought his unique vision to the world of card games with Nomad Poker.
						</p>
						<p class="text-amber-50 text-lg">
							Based in Roseville, California, Randy continues to develop and refine Nomad Poker, working with a dedicated 
							team of supporters to bring this exciting game to bars, casinos, and gaming venues across the country.
						</p>
					</div>
				</Card>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	
	<!-- Jumpman Legacy -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-emerald-900">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-yellow-400 text-center mb-12">A Legacy of Innovation</h2>
			<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
					<Card>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-4">Jumpman (1983)</h3>
						<p class="text-amber-50 mb-4">
							Randy Glover's Jumpman was a groundbreaking platform game that became an instant classic. 
							Released in 1983, it featured innovative gameplay mechanics, challenging levels, and a 
							distinctive style that set it apart from other games of its era.
						</p>
						<p class="text-amber-50">
							The game's success demonstrated Randy's ability to create engaging, memorable gaming experiences 
							that stand the test of time. That same creative vision and attention to detail is evident in Nomad Poker.
						</p>
					</Card>
					<Card>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-4">Nomad Poker (2025)</h3>
						<p class="text-amber-50 mb-4">
							Building on decades of game design expertise, Nomad Poker represents a new direction in card game innovation. 
							The game's unique two-dimensional betting system creates a fresh, strategic experience that appeals to both 
							casual players and serious gamers.
						</p>
						<p class="text-amber-50">
							Just as Jumpman revolutionized platform gaming, Nomad Poker is poised to revolutionize the card game experience 
							in bars and casinos, offering something truly unique in the gaming landscape.
						</p>
					</Card>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	
	<!-- Game Development Story -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-emerald-950">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<Card>
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-400 mb-6">The Story Behind Nomad Poker</h2>
					<div class="space-y-4 text-amber-50 text-lg">
						<p>
							Nomad Poker was born from a desire to create a card game that combined the excitement of traditional poker 
							with innovative mechanics that would appeal to a new generation of players. The concept of a two-dimensional 
							betting system—where players can move their bets between adjacent hands as cards are revealed—adds a layer of 
							strategy and engagement that sets it apart from other card games.
						</p>
						<p>
							The game's development has been a collaborative effort, with Randy working closely with a dedicated team of 
							supporters including P.C., M.S.#1, B.K., M.S.#2, and R.G.#3. Their continued support and feedback have been 
							instrumental in refining the game mechanics and ensuring that Nomad Poker delivers an exceptional gaming experience.
						</p>
						<p>
							As of 2025, final game development continues, with regular updates shared on the Nomad Poker YouTube channel. 
							The game is being prepared for launch in bars and casinos, where it promises to bring a fresh, exciting option 
							to gaming venues across the country.
						</p>
					</div>
				</Card>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	
	<!-- Why Nomad Poker is Unique -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-emerald-900">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-yellow-400 text-center mb-12">What Makes Nomad Poker Unique?</h2>
			<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
				<Card>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-3">Two-Dimensional Gameplay</h3>
					<p class="text-amber-50">
						Unlike traditional card games where you're locked into a single hand, Nomad Poker allows players to move their 
						bet between adjacent hands, creating a dynamic, strategic experience.
					</p>
				</Card>
				<Card>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-3">Progressive Revelation</h3>
					<p class="text-amber-50">
						Cards are revealed one at a time, building suspense and giving players multiple opportunities to adjust their 
						strategy throughout each round.
					</p>
				</Card>
				<Card>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-3">Accessible Yet Strategic</h3>
					<p class="text-amber-50">
						Easy to learn for newcomers, but with enough depth to keep experienced players engaged. The perfect balance for 
						social gaming environments.
					</p>
				</Card>
				<Card>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-3">Social & Engaging</h3>
					<p class="text-amber-50">
						The game naturally encourages interaction and discussion among players, making it ideal for bars and social venues 
						where atmosphere is key.
					</p>
				</Card>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	
	<!-- Credibility Section -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-emerald-950">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<Card>
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-400 mb-6 text-center">Why Partner with Nomad Poker?</h2>
					<div class="space-y-4 text-amber-50 text-lg">
						<p>
							When you partner with Nomad Poker, you're not just getting a new card game—you're getting a game designed by 
							a proven industry veteran with a track record of creating successful, engaging gaming experiences.
						</p>
						<p>
							Randy Glover's legacy with Jumpman demonstrates his ability to create games that resonate with players and stand 
							the test of time. That same commitment to quality, innovation, and player engagement is built into every aspect 
							of Nomad Poker.
						</p>
						<p class="text-center pt-4">
							<strong class="text-yellow-400">Ready to bring this innovative game to your venue?</strong>
						</p>
						<div class="text-center mt-6">
							<a 
								href="/contact"
								class="inline-block bg-yellow-500 hover:bg-yellow-400 text-emerald-900 font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors"
							>
								Contact Us Today
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</Card>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
